From: yaegerbomb42 <yaeger.james42@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 13:31:18 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(swarmagents): add npm run test:all full quality gate

Adds scripts/test-all.sh which runs typecheck -> unit tests -> production
build -> boots the built app against a fake VM driver with a temp SWARM_HOME
on a free port -> local e2e -> teardown, exiting non-zero on the first
failure. Wired up as 'npm run test:all' and documented in the README.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
